1
00:00:01,890 --> 00:00:04,360
Click the instrument name on the chart to pick another one.

2
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:10,940
Type part of the name, then click the instrument.

3
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:13,160
Right-click the chart for its own menu.

4
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:16,320
Save as template keeps this chart's indicators and settings under a name.

5
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:20,690
Apply template puts a saved template on any chart.

6
00:00:20,790 --> 00:00:22,900
The button at the top of the drawing bar opens the Actions menu.

7
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:27,760
Undo, redo, delete, clear, hide or lock the drawings on this chart.

8
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:31,330
Toggle Fullscreen gives the chart the whole window.

9
00:00:31,430 --> 00:00:35,950
Click the same button again to bring the panels back.

10
00:00:36,050 --> 00:00:39,500
This button turns all charts off, to save memory and processor time.

11
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:46,080
Click it again to turn them back on.

